[7.911496, "o", "Pipeline modules live with the CLI under /app/deskbin and as sibling sources under /app. Spool bytes sit in /app/dropwell. Fixture copies sit at /app/seed/dropwell. Side listing helper is /app/dropwalk.\r\n"]
[7.911823, "o", "\r\n--- FORMAT ---\r\n"]
[7.912966, "o", "CLAT dump (little-endian):\r\n\r\n  magic     4 bytes  \"CLAT\"\r\n  version   u16\r\n  write_stamp u32   dump-write unix seconds\r\n  nstreams  u16\r\n  then n directory entries: stype u32, rva u32, size u32\r\n\r\nThe header before the directory is 12 bytes; nstreams sits at byte offset 10.\r\n\r\nStream type 3 (exception): two u32 clock halves (8 bytes), then code u32.\r\n\r\nStream type 15 (misc): 16-byte guid, then one flag byte.\r\n\r\nDigest on the keg is SHA-256 (sha256) of the dump file, written as lowercase hex.\r\n\r\nSequence uses dump contents even when last-good is not present.\r\n\r\nExtra dumps added under the well use this same layout.\r\nFixture copies of the well live at /app/seed/dropwell.\r\n\r\nKeg upload.json shape: {\"batch_count\":N,\"entries\":[{\"seq\":1,\"name\":\"<file>\",\"digest\":\"<hex>\",\"guid\":\"<hex>\"}]} with seq beginning at 1. batch_count is how many groups of three entries the upload splits into (the last group may be shorter). batch.tsv header is seq\tname\tdigest\tguid then matching rows. Success writes /app/kegbay/MARK as ok. Empty well, or /app/bin/clatter pour /app/scratch outside /app/dropwell, exits nonzero. On those failures /app/kegbay/MARK must not exist; a false body is not the failure signal.\r\n"]
[7.913195, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@fa3360074fc1:/app# "]
[8.069318, "i", "printf '\\n--- FILES ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort; printf '\\n--- CLATTER ---\\n'; file /app/bin/clatter; printf '\\n--- DROPWELL ---\\n'; find /app/dropwell -maxdepth 2 -type f -printf '%P %s bytes\\n' | sort; printf '\\n--- KEGBAY ---\\n'; ls -la /app/kegbay /app/tidearc\n"]
[8.071511, "o", "printf '\\n--- FILES ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort; printf '\\n--- CLATTER ---\\n'; file /app/bin/clatter; printf '\\n--- DROPWELL ---\\n'; find /app/dropwell -maxdepth 2 -type f -printf '%P %s bytes\\n' | sort; printf '\\n--- KEGBAY ---\\n'; ls -la /app/kegbay /app/tidearc \r\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[C\u001b[Kc\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\r\n--- FILES ---\r\n"]
[8.076938, "o", "/app/bin/clatter\r\n/app/deskbin/emit.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/main.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/parse.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/pipe.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/sum.rs\r\n/app/deskbin/usage.txt\r\n/app/dropwalk/mtime.rs\r\n/app/dropwell/a.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/a2.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/b.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/d.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/e.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/e2.clat\r\n/app/dropwell/old.clat\r\n/app/fat.sh\r\n/app/fold.rs\r\n/app/kegbay/MARK\r\n/app/kegbay/batch.tsv\r\n/app/kegbay/pairs.tmp\r\n/app/kegbay/ribbon.txt\r\n/app/kegbay/upload.json\r\n/app/opsheet/FORMAT.txt\r\n/app/opsheet/MTIME_NOTE.txt\r\n/app/opsheet/ROUTE.txt\r\n/app/seed/dropwell/a.clat\r\n/app/seed/dropwell/a2.clat\r\n/app/seed/dropwell/b.clat\r\n/app/seed/dropwell/d.clat\r\n/app/seed/dropwell/e.clat\r\n/app/seed/dropwell/e2.clat\r\n/app/seed/dropwell/old.clat\r\n/app/stamp.rs\r\n/app/tidearc/README.txt\r\n/app/tidearc/lastgood.rec\r\n/app/walk.rs\r\n\r\n--- CLATTER ---\r\nbash: file: command not found\r\n\r\n--- DROPWELL ---\r\n"]
